under libc++ the std::map range (map-ref) does not compile — c2mir check errors in libc++'s <map>/<__tree> bodies ("incompatible argument type for struct/union type parameter", "conversion of non-scalar value requested"); v0.105.0 refuses this test under libc++ too (incompatible argument type for pointer type parameter), so not a regression (owner 2026-10-21); the libstdc++ lanes hold the test
